From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Strix Halo Packaging <packaging@example.invalid>
Date: Sat, 25 Apr 2026 00:00:00 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Support the Arch amdclang toolchain in SCons

AOCL-LibM builds with -Werror, and the repo's open-source amdclang lane sees
macro redefinition warnings in upstream headers. Keep those warnings from
failing the package build while leaving AOCL-LibM 5.3's native compiler-feature
and linker probes intact.
---
 src/SConscript | 2 +-
 1 file changed, 1 insertion(+), 1 deletion(-)

diff --git a/src/SConscript b/src/SConscript
index 773df284..26a81e3f 100644
--- a/src/SConscript
+++ b/src/SConscript
@@ -49,7 +49,7 @@ if env['HOST_OS'] != 'win32':
                '-W',
                '-Wstrict-prototypes',
                '-Werror',
-               '-Wno-unused-parameter',
+               '-Wno-unused-parameter', '-Wno-macro-redefined',
                '-fPIC',
               ]
     if use_asan == 1:
